[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422276794","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116128#issuecomment-4422276794","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116128","id":4422276794,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB5aWug","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T15:45:25Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T15:47:55Z","body":"This is wrong. Global history is also used for external resources (i.e. saved to a file) that you may be editing in the inspector. And even without that, it may be sometimes desirable to undo/redo settings outside the settings dialog (e.g. undo editor language change to see how different parts of the editor are behaving). Either way, this can't be fixed properly without https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13427\r\n\r\nI'd look into why the linked issue is a regression (if it is really). The fact that you can undo editor settings outside the dialog is not really related to that, it was always this way.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos